Proposed `sent_deferred_roster` and wrote it to `runs\Absolute_2026-09-28_02\decisions\cycle-002\proposal-2.json`.

For each synchronized detection and depth pair, stage 2 still runs once on the pallet `select_detection` already chooses. `PalletPoseStamped` then carries that candidate's source index as sent, and the other class-matched source indices from the same detection array as deferred. Those indices are the slots `extract_detection_candidates` already stores, and the message already has this pair's RGB and depth stamps. If the estimate fails, the same two lists go on the failure diagnostic.
